摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"dsh plugin: flexible model switch for sub‑agent & plan execution. 为子代理和计划执行选择更合适的模型。","id":"gh:1336292944","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-model-switch","slug":"lincong1987/dsh-model-switch","topics":["ai-agent","ai-agents","deepseek-harness","dsh-model-switch","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-desktop","dsh-plugins","model-switch","model-switcher","model-switching","plugin","plugins","subagent","subagents"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"dsh plugin: flexible model switch for sub‑agent & plan execution. 为子代理和计划执行选择更合适的模型。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-model-switch"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Use the right model for each stage of work in DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"The main conversation, subagents, and plan execution serve different purposes. `dsh-model-switch` le"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ts each of them use a suitable model without changing the normal DSH workflow."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Why use it"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Match models to tasks** — keep your preferred model in the main conversation and use another mod"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"el for subagents or plan execution.\n- **Avoid repeated switching** — save defaults once instead of c"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"hanging models before every task.\n- **Confirm before execution** — review or change the model direct"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ly in the plan approval panel.\n- **See what subagents use** — display the model, context window, and"},{"id":"p7s5","text":" reasoning effort, such as `GPT-5.6 Sol 1M Max`.\n- **Keep the main model unchanged** — after plan ex"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"ecution, DSH restores the previous main-session model."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Configure model defaults"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Choose the model for plan execution"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### See the model used by a subagent"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Open a subagent session to see its model, context window, and reasoning effort in the session header"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"pen a subagent session to see its model, context window, and reasoning effort in the session header."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Use the GitHub spec. This plugin is not published as an npm package, so do not use `@lincong1987/dsh"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"spec. This plugin is not published as an npm package, so do not use `@lincong1987/dsh-model-switch`."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Replace `web` with the profile DSH is actually running. DeepSeek Harness Desktop typically uses `des"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"e `web` with the profile DSH is actually running. DeepSeek Harness Desktop typically uses `desktop`."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Restart DSH after installation."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Update DSH"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"This plugin has been typechecked and built against DeepSeek Harness **0.2.0-rc.2**. The manifest dec"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"lares the compatible peer range `^0.2.0-rc.2`; later releases are not runtime-tested by this change."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"If you upgrade DSH, use the normal channel for that installation. Desktop updates its bundled DSH th"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"rough the app updater; updating npm or `npx` does not replace Desktop's copy. Follow DSH release not"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"es and back up `~/.dsh` (Windows: `%USERPROFILE%\\.dsh`) before crossing a release that changes on-di"},{"id":"p20s4","text":" up `~/.dsh` (Windows: `%USERPROFILE%\\.dsh`) before crossing a release that changes on-disk formats."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"After a DSH upgrade, reinstall this plugin with `--force` as described below."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Reinstall / after a DSH update"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Reinstall the plugin when this repository changes, or after you upgrade DeepSeek Harness. This chang"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"e was verified against **0.2.0-rc.2**; the package peer range is `^0.2.0-rc.2`."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"1. Update DSH first (see Update DSH; skip this step if only the plugin changed).\n2. Reinstall with `"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"--force` so DSH refreshes the GitHub source:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"3. Restart DSH."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"On Desktop, run **one** `plugin add` at a time. Fully **Exit** from the tray (closing the window is "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"not enough), wait until Desktop finishes starting, then reinstall, then Exit and reopen again. If in"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"stall fails with `another plugin install recovery transaction is pending`, quit Desktop, wait, and r"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"etry once. If it is still pending, quit Desktop, delete `%APPDATA%\\DSH Desktop\\plugin-install-recove"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"ry`, reopen Desktop, then run a single `add --force`."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"To bypass the Desktop wrapper, run the matching DSH CLI in a normal terminal:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Use"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"1. Open **Settings → Model switch**.\n2. Configure the **Subagent model** and **Plan execution model*"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"*:\n- **Follow main model** uses the current conversation model.\n- **Custom** lets you choose a model"},{"id":"p31s3","text":" and reasoning effort.\n3. When reviewing a plan, confirm or change the execution model before select"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"ffort.\n3. When reviewing a plan, confirm or change the execution model before selecting **Approve**."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The model selected in the plan review panel takes priority over the saved plan-execution setting."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Built and typechecked against DeepSeek Harness **0.2.0-rc.2** (peer range `^0.2.0-rc.2`). Settings a"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"re the plugin entry's validated `Config`, persisted through DSH's settings Remote under the loader e"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"ntry id `model-switch`."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Subagent model switching applies to in-process subagents such as `spawn` and `fork`. External-proces"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"s agents may manage their models independently."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"DSH 0.1.2-alpha.1 also introduced a native, agent-driven model selection for subagents (the agent pi"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"cks provider/model/effort within its authorization). This plugin is complementary: it enforces a fix"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"ed, user-configured routing policy instead, and adds the plan-execution model switch, restore, and s"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"ession model badges."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Community"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Links"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- Linux.do"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
